{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act52side", "eventName": "昨日海", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "YW-3", "avgTag": "行动前", "storyName": "破手铐", "storyInfo": "纳乔为阿奎拉被捕一事向互助会求助，与奥卢斯相遇。克莱门莎决定与卡门商议岛民问题的解决方法，而卡门也下定决心要改革审判庭。", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g5_gdsquare_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$darkness01_intro", "key": "$darkness01_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉被捕了？", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她利用船厂的骚乱在人群中进行交易，我用了点小方法，把她和同伙引到了方便动手的地方。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可惜，她已完成交易，现在正在接受审讯，我应该插不了手。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉的意志很坚定，我担心盲目审讯，效果会适得其反。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这次交易显然是在为了之后的行动做准备，但目前为止她没有交代任何信息。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我会顺着互助会的线索继续追查，希望能在未知的威胁来临之前找到些头绪。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过，我必须提醒你，这次行动牵扯的岛民可不止阿奎拉一个。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就算审判庭想要维稳，也不可能无视放在台面上的危险。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这件事我会想办法处理。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如我之前所说，大规模搜查会妨碍打捞计划，更重要的是会再次激起伊比利亚人对岛民的愤懑。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "调和岛民与伊比利亚人的矛盾是我与伊比利亚阁下共同的愿望，岛民伤害伊比利亚的利益实则也是在伤害他们自身。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果不能打破恶性循环，即使雷亚-伊比利亚重回海岸线也无法将伊比利亚人凝聚在一起。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，圣徒阁下可是交给了你一件难事。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我本就无法忽视任何一个求助的人。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你可以说我傲慢。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不骂自讨苦吃的人。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "对了，阿奎拉被捕时托我转交一件东西，审判庭检查之后没有发现危险，我就带来了。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔丢的螺栓……她在海里找到的？", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "和假肢上的其他零件都不一样，它看起来像是黄金时代的旧物。也难怪纳乔那么惦记它……", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉对同胞的关怀确实不假。那么有毅力的人，何苦要走歪路？岛民和伊比利亚的积怨真是消磨人啊。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g2_courtprison", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_armour"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2277_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2277_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大审判官阁下，人带到了。", "name": "惩戒军士官"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "还需要我们做什么吗？", "name": "惩戒军士官"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "去船厂驻守吧，然后给艾丽妮带一条口信，就说……我的伤情又严重了，身体不适。如果今天圣徒阁下有事要商谈，请她代我前往。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 73, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2277_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是。", "name": "惩戒军士官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2277_1#1$1"}, {"id": 75, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_armour"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "duration": 1.0, "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "审判官对自己的同僚竟然也会说谎，这倒是让我舒心了一些——你们不是只在岛民问题上编故事。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#5$1"}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不用挑衅我。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我处理过太多深海教徒和普通岛民，无辜的、仇恨的、发疯的……几乎什么都见过了。所以我也知道该怎么对待你们。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可以说，我比你们还要了解你们自己。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你怎么敢……！", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1"}, {"id": 88, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我并不是想要侮辱你们，不过只有这样，我才能不犯错。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我对岛民并无恨意，让无辜之人枉死只会玷污我对伊比利亚崇高德行的坚守。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在船厂，我逐渐明白了一些道理——有些船哪怕修补好了，也是无法在海上航行的。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "审判庭早就注意到了互助会的动向，只是你们的集会一直非常隐蔽，隐蔽到我开始怀疑是否有人在用独特的法术替你们遮掩。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今天终于能跟你们好好聊一聊了。告诉我，你们到底想做什么？", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 94, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g3_seasidest_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0, "type": "bg", "from": 0.0, "to": 0.8, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$monastery_sad_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_oldman_walk"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 5.0, "ystrength": 5.0, "vibrato": 5.0, "randomness": 10.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.1}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 5.0, "ystrength": 5.0, "vibrato": 5.0, "randomness": 10.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.1}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 5.0, "ystrength": 5.0, "vibrato": 5.0, "randomness": 10.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.1}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "互助会的教堂……阿奎拉告诉我的应该就是这个街区，到底在哪儿……", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔……", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$bodyfalldown1"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 5.0, "ystrength": 20.0, "vibrato": 10.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 0.0, "fillfrom": 0.0, "fillto": 0.2, "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 4.0, "fillfrom": 0.0, "fillto": 0.2, "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "gridbg", "attributes": {"imagegroup": "44_g13_afterglow_L1/44_g13_afterglow_R1/44_g13_afterglow_L2/44_g13_afterglow_R2", "solidwidth": "1280/1280/1280/1280", "solidheight": "720/720/720/720", "y": 500.0}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "largebgtween", "attributes": {"duration": 60.0, "yFrom": 700.0, "yTo": 500.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 0.0, "type": "bg", "from": 0.0, "to": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "困惑、慌乱、悲哀、愤怒的心情被困在纳乔的身体之中，让他忽视了自己手臂的伤口已经进一步恶化。"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他想知道阿奎拉为什么宁愿拼命也不愿意安安稳稳地生活下去，他想让纷争消失在伊比利亚，他想找到所有问题的解决方法。"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_gateopen"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一扇门，为疑惑、困苦、向往和平的阿戈尔人打开。"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（意识模糊）教堂……", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "终于见到你了，纳乔。别担心，我是阿奎拉的导师，我会帮助你。", "name": "奥卢斯"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_gatecloz"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "gridbg", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g11_clmsoffice", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您终于回来了，技术工阿奎拉——", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1"}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我已经知道了。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2268_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您知道了？您是遇到纳乔了吗？", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#5$1"}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔？", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1"}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉出事后他想找您帮忙，但看您不在就离开了。", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1"}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "派小帮手去找找他，打捞中心的人不能再出意外了。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}, {"id": 160, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2268_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#4$1"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "审判庭已经带走了更多人？", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "暂时还没有，但您自己看吧。", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1"}, {"id": 166, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉、索莱达、马修、盖乌斯……审判庭传来的调查名单涉及了打捞中心三分之一的工作人员，而且全是阿戈尔人。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}, {"id": 168, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉的案件已经牵扯进许多岛民，您明白处理他们的问题存在外交风险。", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1"}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哪怕你我都能猜到，审判庭其实需要通过这次外交合作解决他们与岛民的矛盾？", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我并不认为陆上的人有足够的理性，能在直接面对这种情况的时候，不把阿戈尔的举动理解为“插手他们的家务事”。", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1"}, {"id": 174, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那关于岛民本身，你是怎么想的？", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}, {"id": 176, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "请恕我直言，对于选择前往陆地的同胞，阿戈尔接受他们的选择，但也达成了一个共识——他们需要承担选择的结果。", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1"}, {"id": 178, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而现在，他们的后代在伊比利亚生活已久，他们习惯了伊比利亚的行事风格，对阿戈尔的制度和理念没有丝毫认知。", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1"}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然如此，我们为什么要强行以同胞的身份干预他们和伊比利亚的矛盾？", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1"}, {"id": 180, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那只会显得阿戈尔之前所有的宽容，都只是因为没有亲眼见过这些岛民真实的遭遇。", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1"}, {"id": 181, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你认为我过于同情岛民的遭遇，而同情是不合时宜的，是吗？", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}, {"id": 183, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2268_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#8$1"}, {"id": 185, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的。", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#1$1"}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "第一批离开本境的阿戈尔人为何上岸？", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2268_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "海嗣侵蚀了他们的家园，他们是……难民。", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#4$1"}, {"id": 191, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿戈尔无法否认，它没有保护好自己的人民，更别提像科学发展规划所标榜的那样——“给予每位公民选择”。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "正因如此，我才没法打着“尊重”的旗号，对他们的境遇坐视不理。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们对阿戈尔的诸多事宜都有截然不同的看法，塔西塔。我不会要求你认同我的观点，甚至我认为，你不应该认同阿戈尔给出的观点。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只要有怀疑，只要有猜想，你都可以去消除、去验证，我会支持。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 196, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但同情不会是不合时宜的，哪怕从理性出发，同情也是一种全新的思路——让人不至于因为自傲而找错解法的思路。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2268_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我明白……不，我会再思考一下。", "name": "塔西塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2268_1#2$1"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，去吧。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 201, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "loop": "true", "channel": "r"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "r", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "duration": 1.0, "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_telephonebusy"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_ringoff", "channel": "2"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "别来无恙，伊比利亚阁下。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在打捞启动仪式上，您曾隐晦地认同，以我为代表的阿戈尔方有权参与处理岛民问题。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的，我已经决定了。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 214, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "虽然涉及外交层面的说辞难免遭人曲解，我个人也倾向于直面问题而非回避……", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我希望那些已经疲于应付纷争的岛民能有一次选择的机会——", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 216, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "选择留在伊比利亚，或者回到阿戈尔。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}, {"id": 218, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g1_cmoffice", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_telephone"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1"}, {"id": 227, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$doorknockquite"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "圣徒阁下。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "斐戴拉大审判官呢？", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#10$1"}, {"id": 236, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大审判官阁下的伤势又重了，向船厂告了假，她让我代她赴约。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 238, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "斐戴拉，我的学生……哪怕关于未来的许诺放在她面前，她还是会怀疑。不过，这样也好。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1"}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您的意思是，大审判官阁下其实不想来港都外围城区？", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#12$1"}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，她一边相信着伊比利亚的明天，一边又害怕它会背叛她。她不愿接受我的劝诫，也不愿听更复杂的解释。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "圣徒阁下，斐戴拉大审判官太疲倦了，如果她的决心发生动摇，我……抱歉，我认为是完全可以理解的。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她的决心从未动摇过，艾丽妮。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 248, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这才是她今天没有来的原因。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 249, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那我……", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 251, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你知道我刚刚在跟谁通话？", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 253, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "应该是克莱门莎监事，想来是为了技术工阿奎拉被逮捕的事。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 255, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你如何看待她的举动？", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我曾在弥利亚留姆询问阿戈尔人对岛民问题的看法。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们十分理性地表示理解，那种状态甚至很难被称为“谅解”，而是一种另类的“不关心”。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因此我认为，克莱门莎监事插手伊比利亚的岛民问题大概率是她的个人决定。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 261, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你觉得这样的个人决定是否违背阿戈尔的意志？", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 263, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果她的意志能引领阿戈尔走向更远的未来，那她的意志也可能成为阿戈尔的意志。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 265, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#2$1"}, {"id": 267, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "点亮提灯，艾丽妮。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 269, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 271, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "圣徒阁下，我们要往哪走？", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#12$1"}, {"id": 273, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "往下走。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 275, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_black", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_openftstpwalk"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我成为审判官的那天，来过这里。我还记得里面关押的那只海嗣。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "每位审判官在成为审判官前，都要见它一面。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 287, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "达里奥只是冷冷地看着它，像看一具尸体。斐戴拉当场就拔出剑来要杀了它，如果不是我拦下了她，这只海嗣早就已经死了。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 288, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "最终，他们的结论都和你一样——它是敌人。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 289, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它在这里被关押了多久？", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在这里，六十三年，但如果要追溯它来到伊比利亚的时间，则近百年。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 293, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "黄金时代就有海嗣作乱了吗？", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 295, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "作乱？不。它曾是斯图提斐拉最珍贵的战利品，伊比利亚伟大征服的象征。老国王特地选在亲王的命名日那天为它揭幕。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1"}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他甚至命令术师们在它身上刻写炼金术式，把它置于造船厂的核心，让它成为驱动这座精密而庞大的都城的重要力量。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1"}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等……这只海嗣曾在造船厂，用于驱动雷亚-伊比利亚，那……", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#12$1"}, {"id": 300, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我调派斐戴拉管理船厂的目的之一是为了让她休养，而另一个目的，就是将这只海嗣重新安置进船厂——这是打捞中心城区的一环。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不明白……", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 304, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果您让斐戴拉大审判官管理船厂，本意应该就是想让她知晓这些过往。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 305, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这只海嗣她也曾见过，您无需担心她无法完成接收它的任务，可您为什么又说大审判官阁下不来也好？", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 306, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因为关于这只海嗣的故事，在大静谧之后，还有后续。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 308, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "向下看，艾丽妮。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 309, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_openftstpwalk"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "74_i06_1", "xScale": 1.1, "yScale": 1.1, "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.1, "yScaleFrom": 1.1, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "duration": 30.0}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$chenandwei_intro", "key": "$chenandwei_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大静谧时，我与我的一位同僚从港都带走了这只海嗣。不是为了缅怀什么，而是为了知晓我们即将面临的，究竟是什么。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "多么讽刺，我们曾经对它视若珍宝，后来对它恨之入骨，但最后，还是要借助它来照亮前路。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您从不会对我们使用虚无缥缈的修辞。“照亮前路”……您指的就是我们的灯火？但，怎么可能？", "name": "艾丽妮"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "点亮你手里那盏灯的，仍是你坚定不移的信念。几个月前，你在斯图提斐拉号上就已经证明了这一点。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但信念本身不过是一些抽象的道理。真正使它不朽的，永远是人的爱憎。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……就如同老师深爱着这片土地。", "name": "艾丽妮"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "以及，憎恨着海嗣。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嵌在那盏灯里的施术单元，没法辨别你的信条，但它读得到你最炽烈的爱憎之情。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大静谧之后，伊比利亚人连直视大海都会感到恐惧，更妄论剿灭海嗣。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "审判庭选拔出意志最为坚韧的士兵，也应给他们足够称手的武器，我们需要建立对抗大海的手段，哪怕它来自那片海本身。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以“审判官必须直面海嗣”同样也不是一种虚无缥缈的修辞——", "name": "艾丽妮"}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因为我们必须理解它，然后选择憎恨它，法术才能被维系，灯火才会被点亮。", "name": "艾丽妮"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果今后它作为雷亚-伊比利亚的核心，那……", "name": "艾丽妮"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "维系灯火的法术不会立刻受到影响，不过会在不久之后彻底失去它们原本的效用。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "从它重回船厂的那一刻起，与灯火连接紧密的审判官们便会感觉意志被微微摇动，正如海风中的烛火。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这将是他们决心成为审判官之后不得不经历的，第二次考验。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "艾丽妮"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你可以质疑我，甚至直接在这里挑战我。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在同意实施打捞计划的那一刻，我已经想好了一切后果，包括我要承担的，和伊比利亚要承担的。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "圣徒阁下，我只是在想，我明白了您刚刚在办公室里问我的话。", "name": "艾丽妮"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果克莱门莎监事的意志有可能变成阿戈尔意志的一部分，那对于伊比利亚而言，从今往后照亮前路的，也未必只能是审判庭。", "name": "艾丽妮"}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且，我想起了另一件事。", "name": "艾丽妮"}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在遇到达里奥老师之前，我只是个普通孩子，受了点训练，甚至没在惩戒军中服役过。", "name": "艾丽妮"}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "老师总说我太虔诚、太忠心，太相信审判庭的经文与律法就是我的一切……在老师眼里，那是我最大的弱点。", "name": "艾丽妮"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他希望我的正义能扎根于我双眼见过的景色、双耳听过的话语、双脚走过的土地，而非经文与律法。", "name": "艾丽妮"}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我希望所有伊比利亚人都能如此。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这些人，哪怕只是为了不那么痛苦地吞咽那些石头似的鳞干，都需要在心中默念经文。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但也是这些人，会不自觉地跟着路边一个孩童唱起不成调子的船歌。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊比利亚人，应当有在夜晚独自行走的权利，灯火不应该只属于审判庭。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如今，阿戈尔在前线为伊比利亚带来了喘息的机会，过去百年的经验在警告我，伊比利亚的时间一向十分宝贵。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "把这只海嗣带走。然后，如在伊比利亚的每一天一样，做好准备。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_match"}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_062cg_phantom_front", "layer": 1.0, "y": 0.0}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "74_i06_2", "xScale": 1.4, "yScale": 1.4, "screenadapt": "coverall", "fadetime": 3.0, "y": 100.0}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.4, "yScaleFrom": 1.4, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "duration": 40.0, "yTo": 0.0, "xTo": 0.0}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "圣徒划亮一根火柴，它的光芒明亮、耀眼，与审判庭的粉色灯火相比，毫不逊色。"}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "火光映亮了海嗣交缠的、可怖的触肢，而它很快就要离开审判庭的牢笼，回到那座造船厂，回到它原本被关押的地方。"}}, {"id": 367, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "艾丽妮无法确定，没有法术维系的灯火是否依旧能抵挡海嗣。她更不确定的是，等到灯火熄灭时，审判庭的信仰是否会遭受动摇。"}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但至少，艾丽妮可以确定自己不会。"}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她见过战死在灯塔之下的达里奥，她也见过内向但坚韧的乔迪，她知道伊比利亚人可以做到更多，只是黑夜笼罩了他们太久。"}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她相信圣徒阁下的判断。更重要的是，在亲眼看过、亲身经历过之后，她也相信自己的判断。"}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 376, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}